            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1,
            "endIndex": 53,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1,
                  "endIndex": 53,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Cottonworld — Added active product PDP descriptions\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.6rqe8my2xkw4",
                "namedStyleType": "TITLE",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 53,
            "endIndex": 59,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 53,
                  "endIndex": 59,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Scope\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.keblwqqdo708",
                "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 59,
            "endIndex": 307,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 59,
                  "endIndex": 307,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "392 product descriptions were added to the Boltworks sheet, column C, rows 2–393. They follow the earlier active-batch format: a product introduction, sourced construction and care details where available, a styling note, and the exact Product ID.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 307,
            "endIndex": 321,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 307,
                  "endIndex": 321,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Source checks\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.vd9hrvwsvaye",
                "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 321,
            "endIndex": 692,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 321,
                  "endIndex": 692,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "388 descriptions use the Cottonworld product export for product identity, fabric composition, fit, pattern, garment details, and available care instructions. All 392 descriptions passed checks for repeated fabric and colour words, duplicate bodies, product IDs, gender labels, and description structure. After the second copy review, the median body length is 110 words.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 692,
            "endIndex": 1089,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 692,
                  "endIndex": 1089,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Four rows have narrower evidence. Row 24 uses the supplied product URL for the women’s navy linen blouse and boxy fit; the source export has no matching record. Rows 293–295 use merchant variant records for the men’s cotton shirts in khaki, olive, and wine. The proposed product URLs for these four rows returned 404 during this check. Confirm the four product records before publishing the copy.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1089,
            "endIndex": 1096,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1089,
                  "endIndex": 1096,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Review\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.nk6qwusib079",
                "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1096,
            "endIndex": 1363,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1096,
                  "endIndex": 1363,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Column C was read back against every generated description. The supplied product URLs and updated URLs in columns A and B were preserved. The description cells wrap, and the new header matches the existing header style. The rendered sheet was checked at normal zoom.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1363,
            "endIndex": 1387,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1363,
                  "endIndex": 1385,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Updated Google Sheet: ",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                },
                {
                  "startIndex": 1385,
                  "endIndex": 1386,
                  "richLink": {
                    "richLinkId": "kix.lo3gjoozfpg7",
                    "textStyle": {},
                    "richLinkProperties": {
                      "title": "New Active list products PDP Descriptions",
                      "uri": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1yZt5VrfS04g9Uz6rDkB6AtO5VYUsLK_h42sHg3gJow0/edit",
                      "mimeType": "application/vnd.google-apps.ritz"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "startIndex": 1386,
                  "endIndex": 1387,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1387,
            "endIndex": 1421,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1387,
                  "endIndex": 1421,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Copyedit recheck — 6 October 2026\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.96bkfb92dd6m",
                "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1421,
            "endIndex": 1866,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1421,
                  "endIndex": 1866,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "A copy check covered all 392 descriptions. The copy in 389 rows was revised to reduce repeated stock phrases, repeated words and sentence openings, and awkward styling suggestions. The final check found no adjacent repeated words, repeated three-word phrases, exact or colour-only duplicate description bodies, duplicate product URLs, or mismatched Product IDs. All 392 descriptions were read back from column C; columns A and B were unchanged.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1866,
            "endIndex": 2080,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1866,
                  "endIndex": 2080,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Product-data discrepancy: the merchant colour field for row 370 says brown, while the product title and both supplied URLs say olive. The description now says olive. Confirm that merchant field before publication.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 2080,
            "endIndex": 2116,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 2080,
                  "endIndex": 2116,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Second copy review — 7 October 2026\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.5oabj9szoty5",
                "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 2116,
            "endIndex": 2650,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 2116,
                  "endIndex": 2650,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "A fresh check covered all 392 PDP rows against the saved merchant product records, product titles and URLs, and the current Sheet. Styling notes in 147 rows were corrected: unintroduced jacket references were removed, bag and accessory suggestions were made coherent, and men’s trouser and top pairings were adjusted. The sourced introductions, garment details, care copy, Product IDs and URL columns were preserved. The final sheet readback matches all revisions, with no duplicate description bodies or within-row repeated phrases.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 2650,
            "endIndex": 2966,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 2650,
                  "endIndex": 2966,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Source follow-up: row 370 remains the only product-export conflict found in this comparison: the merchant colour field says brown, while the title and both supplied URLs say olive. The copy follows olive. Confirm that field before publishing. The product records for rows 24 and 293–295 also remain to be confirmed.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 2966,
            "endIndex": 2967,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 2966,
                  "endIndex": 2967,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
